.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# AI agent instructions, local only. Named here as well as in the global
# ignore, which a session working from a fresh clone does not have.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md

# The audit skill is committed here; the rest of .claude is machine-local.
# `.claude/` is excluded by the global ignore, and a negation cannot reach
# inside an excluded directory, so the directory is re-included first and its
# contents excluded again.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
